## Letter Normalization
Accented Latin characters are normalized before any calculation.

Examples

É → E

È → E

Ê → E

Ë → E

À → A

Â → A

Ä → A

Ù → U

Û → U

Ü → U

Î → I

Ï → I

Ô → O

Ö → O

Ç → C

Œ → OE

Æ → AE

Hyphens are removed.

Spaces are ignored.

Apostrophes are ignored.

Only alphabetic characters are preserved.
