Any non-Latin alphabet
## Reduction Rules
Reduction is performed by summing digits.

Master numbers are preserved.

Supported master numbers

11

22

33

Examples

38

↓

3 + 8 = 11

Result = 11

49

↓

4 + 9 = 13

↓

1 + 3 = 4

Result = 4
